{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"缠结"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"缠结"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>缠结</strong> (tangle) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"扭结","text":"扭结"}},{"Plain":"的带边界推广.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>标架缠结</h3>\n<p>…</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>缠结的等价类等同于图的 Reidemeister 等价类.</p>\n<h3>生成元</h3>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"tangle-ribbon-cat","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}